# Kiosk show mode (user, 2026-11-13), appended by scripts/deploy-test.sh to the
# kiosk's default arguments for every world: always ride on the virtual trainer
# at 500 W, so the rider moves and pedals (the virtual trainer reports a
# matching cadence, ~95 rpm) even with nobody on the KICKR. OCW_KIOSK_ARGS
# replaces everything, this file included.
--virtual
--power 500
# Show mode without collisions (spec §14 Phase 12, 12G): the show rider at
# 500 W rides through the bots instead of bumping into them.
--cmd "ride.collisions off"
# The show rider earns no hearts (spec §14 Phase 4, 4E: never in the kiosk /
# show mode; the virtual trainer earns none anyway).
--no-hearts
